BT /F2 10.5 Tf 28 685.68 Td (Self-check, attempt 1: 10 of 10 correct) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 28 666.6 Td (1. What distinguishes a team from a group?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 44 653.6 Td (Answer: A team shares responsibility, authority, and resources to achieve its collective mission \227 Correct) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 28 634.6 Td (2. What is the primary definition of teamwork?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 44 621.6 Td (Answer: The process of working collaboratively with a group of people in order to achieve a goal \227 Correct) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 28 602.6 Td (3. Which of the following is NOT one of the four objectives of teamwork?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 44 589.6 Td (Answer: Competition \227 Correct) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 28 570.6 Td (4. In Step 1 of working well in a team, what should you do if you finish your work early?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 44 557.6 Td (Answer: Help teammates, bringing the team closer to the goal \227 Correct) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 28 538.6 Td (5. What does 'synergy' mean as a characteristic of effective teams?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 44 525.6 Td (Answer: The team performs in a way greater than the sum of its parts \227 Correct) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 28 506.6 Td (6. Which role is responsible for distributing information to team members and stakeholders?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 44 493.6 Td (Answer: Communicator \227 Correct) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 28 474.6 Td (7. What is one of the key responsibilities of a team leader regarding team members' abilities?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 44 461.6 Td (Answer: Develop strengths and improve weaknesses \227 Correct) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 28 442.6 Td (8. What happens when a team leader demonstrates a confident work ethic?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 44 429.6 Td (Answer: Team members mimic the leader's attitude and confidence inspires confidence \227 Correct) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 28 410.6 Td (9. Which barrier to communication occurs when feelings of fear, distrust, or anger change how messages are sent and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 28 397.6 Td (received?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 44 384.6 Td (Answer: Emotional Barrier \227 Correct) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 28 365.6 Td (10. What is the main advantage of a functional organizational structure?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 44 352.6 Td (Answer: It allows greater operational efficiency because employees with shared skills are grouped together \227 Correct) Tj ET
